Z||000000||Galen||08-22-2001||05:24 PM||||Anyone out there have snakes? We currently have 5 here. 2 mine, 2 are my moms and 1 is my brothers..<P>I have a 1 1/2 ft Ball python and a 2 1/2 ft ball python, my mom has a 3ft California Garter snake(used to be mine, was my first) and a 3 ft ball python. And my brothers is a 6 1/2 ft red tail boa.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> I used to have a 3 1/2-4ft ball, but he died  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> twas a sad day.. poor lloyd(was his name).<P>Anyone have em and do ya have pics?<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.webjolt.f2s.com/sig.gif">  Ray -    <A HREF="mailto:galen@ezrpg.com">galen@ezrpg.com</A>    - <A HREF="http://www.fierolinks.f2s.com/" TARGET=_blank>www.FieroLinks.f2s.com</A><BR>AIM: GalenRPG - ICQ: 98668558||||reg||1
